OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSADrinks cartons and foil added to
OL,4,Acity recycling
OL,5,
OL,6,FFood and drinks cartons and aluminium
OL,7,Ffoil will be added to recycling
OL,8,Fcollections in Brighton and Hove, a
OL,9,Fmove which the council says it hopes
OL,10,Fwill encourage more recycling.
OL,12,FThe city council says fruit juice
OL,13,Fcartons, gravy granule tubes and other
OL,14,Fitems will now be accepted as part of
OL,15,Fnormal collections, rather than needing
OL,16,Fto be taken to recycling points.
OL,18,FThe changes, starting on Monday, come
OL,19,Fafter national changes implemented in
OL,20,FMarch aimed at streamlining the
OL,21,Frecycling process.
OL,23,APub: 16-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
